7. Implementation Status

Assign exactly one status to every requirement:

FULLY_IMPLEMENTED

The requirement is implemented correctly and verified by appropriate tests.

PARTIALLY_IMPLEMENTED

Some required behavior exists, but one or more required behaviors are missing or incorrect.

NOT_IMPLEMENTED

Required functionality does not exist.

INCORRECT_IMPLEMENTATION

Functionality exists but violates the business requirement.

UNVERIFIABLE

The requirement or environment prevents reliable verification.

CONFLICTING_REQUIREMENT

Requirement conflicts with another authoritative requirement/document.

For every non-full status identify the exact gap.

