27. Implement Remediation

For each confirmed implementation gap:

1. Identify root cause.
2. Identify affected components.
3. Design the smallest safe change.
4. Implement production code.
5. Add/update tests.
6. Run targeted tests.
7. Run related integration/functional tests.
8. Fix failures.
9. Run the complete applicable test suite.
10. Verify no regression.
11. Update documentation.

Do not make unrelated refactoring unless necessary.

Prefer minimal, maintainable enterprise-grade changes over large rewrites.

